#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gif2box_theme_home.about_us_content
msgid "One box, everything the occasion needs"
msgstr "ひと箱に、その日に必要なものをすべて"

#. module: gif2box_theme_home
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gif2box_theme_home.about_us_content
msgid "Choosing a present for a newborn or a first birthday can take hours: which brand is safe, which pieces go together, what the family will really use. A Gif2box gift set answers all of it at once: a complete, coordinated set of everyday essentials, in one box, for less than buying each piece."
msgstr "出産祝いや1歳の誕生日プレゼント選びは、どのブランドが安全か、どれを組み合わせるか、本当に使ってもらえるかと、何時間もかかりがちです。Gif2boxのギフトセットなら、そのすべてに一度に応えます。毎日使う必需品を組み合わせたセットを、ひと箱に、単品で揃えるよりお得な価格で。"

#. module: gif2box_theme_home
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gif2box_theme_home.about_us_content
msgid "Curated for the moment"
msgstr "節目に合わせて厳選"

#. module: gif2box_theme_home
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gif2box_theme_home.about_us_content
msgid "Each set is built around a milestone, from welcoming a newborn to a first birthday, with pieces the family will actually use every day."
msgstr "出産祝いから1歳の誕生日まで、それぞれの節目に合わせ、毎日本当に使えるアイテムでセットを組んでいます。"

#. module: gif2box_theme_home
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gif2box_theme_home.about_us_content
msgid "Boxed and ready to give"
msgstr "箱入りでそのまま贈れる"

